# Build context for LabMetricsDashboard/Dockerfile and LRN.ReportsApi/Dockerfile.
# Both are built from the REPOSITORY ROOT, not from their own folder, because each
# project references siblings (LRN.ProductionReports, LRN.ReportQueue.Shared,
# LRN.PayerPolicyMapper.Core) that sit outside its directory.
#
#   docker build -f LabMetricsDashboard/Dockerfile -t lrn-dashboard .
#
# Everything below either bloats the context or must never reach an image.

# ── Secrets: never copy these into a layer ───────────────────────────────────
# The csproj files already set CopyToPublishDirectory=Never, but an intermediate
# layer would still carry them. appsettings.Local.json holds every production
# connection string and the JWT signing key.
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Secrets.json
**/credentials.local.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/.certs/
**/.env
**/.env.local

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# publish/ holds tracked staging dumps of previous deployments - several hundred
# MB of already-built binaries. Sending it to the daemon dominates build time.
publish/
_artifacts/

# ── Tooling / IDE ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.trae/
**/.vercel/

# ── Not needed by any image ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
tests/
docs/
SQL_Scripts/
HelloMauiApp/
**/*.md
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
**/*.log
